                                 ('C', 'C9', 'a mandate to write a template 20 to 40 times', ONE_FORM_C))},
    'land': {k: (d, a, '{}: landed bytes read by the kernel\'s own address arithmetic, a second form of the header\'s '
                 'system-coherent read', 'the header\'s `mesh_step_read`', w)
